## Description

Strava's data is quite protected so I couldn't index it for Hoodmaps  But the good thing is the US Census data publishes median income level and the data is very fresh and accurate, so I added it to 🗺️ https://t.co/OyIH4aqaz1  So now you can switch to [ 💰 Income mode ] and https://t.co/DSRyndNzxs

